<title>USA: Neopath Q1 revs exceed $2.2 million.</title>
<headline>Neopath Q1 revs exceed $2.2 million.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>NeoPath Inc said its rvenues for the first quarter ended March 31 exceeded $2.2 million, about 38 percent above year-ago levels.</p>
<p>The company, which makes products to improve diagnostic accuracy for early detection of cancer, said its full earnings report will be released on April 24.</p>
</text>
